Photon — a rebrand of Lapce

Photon is a derivative (rebrand) of Lapce (https://github.com/lapce/lapce).

* Original work: Copyright Lapce authors (Dongdong Zhou <dzhou121@gmail.com> and contributors).
* Original homepage/docs: https://lapce.dev, https://docs.lapce.dev
* License: Apache License, Version 2.0 — see LICENSE in this repository.
  This LICENSE file is kept intact and unmodified from upstream.

Modifications for Photon consist of renaming user-visible and internal
identifiers from Lapce to Photon (binaries `photon` / `photon-proxy`,
bundle IDs `dev.photon.photon` / `io.photon`, crates `photon-*`, config
paths, etc.).

Per Apache-2.0 §4, all copyright, patent, trademark and attribution notices
from the Source form of the Work have been retained. Upstream dependency
URLs (e.g. github.com/lapce/*) and the lapce-xi-rope crate name were
intentionally left unchanged where they refer to external projects.
